            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>One aspect of the present disclosure relates to a light detection and ranging (LIDAR) system comprising: a laser source configured to output a first beam; and a scanner shaped as an irregular polygon. The scanner of the aspect is configured to reflect the first beam to output a second beam as a scan having a greater sampling density in a first portion of a field of view of the scanner than a second portion of the field of view.</p>
            </abstract>
